Thu Oct 15 05:00:43 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.7.0 (upstream tag v0.7.0):
  * Import: WMF/EMF pictures, RTF code pages and page setup, tables
    laid out on cell edges, Wingdings/Webdings/Symbol as Unicode.
  * Layout: blank pages put sections on the right side, paragraph
    spacing is the larger of after/before, shape drag anchoring.
  * Print through craft-print, Word 2003 XML save, ink kept in runs,
    drawings/VML kept with margins and fit.
  * Track Changes Accept All fix, comment balloons, caret contrast,
    middle-click scroll, MathML copy, Read Aloud without console.
  * Proofing: Italian (it_IT/it_CH) and Croatian spelling/grammar,
    hyphenation catalog, equation gallery and watermarks.
  * Re-vendor with update=true; license audit finds no new copyleft
    (self_cell still Apache-2.0 option), so the License tag is
    unchanged. No CVEs in the v0.6.1 to v0.7.0 range.
  * Scope %check around three 0.7.0 regressions that fail on every
    OBS arch (file-access ratchet tripped by the new Word 2003 sniff
    helper, one GPU-adapter UI test, one headless focus UI test);
    the wall-clock layout skip stays.
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release notes
    for the full list.

